flowchart LR
    start([Start]) --> documents[Process all documents]
    documents --> ready{All documents complete?}
    ready -->|No| wait[Wait for remaining documents]
    wait --> documents
    ready -->|Yes| chunks[(CPTenderDoc)]
    chunks --> filter[Select new chunks]
    filter --> rules[Rule-based filter]
    rules --> llm[Requirement extraction agent]
    llm --> store[(TenderRequirements)]
    store --> finish([Requirement stage complete])
